The master is black with `#00FF41` line art (the Matrix theme's highlight colour),
generated by Summera AI from the original upstream fman icon
(`git show 41eff21a^:src/main/icons/linux/1024.png`) as its reference.

Run `python tools/create_media/build_app_icons.py` from the repository root to
regenerate `Icon.ico` and the PNGs in `base`, `linux`, and `mac`. macOS icons
keep a 10% transparent margin so they do not appear oversized in the Dock or
app switcher.
